cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GaiaMind360 in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GaiaMind360: Environmental AI Platform for Real-Time Planetary Intelligence"
abstract: >
  GaiaMind360 is an open-source environmental AI platform that combines large language
  models, real-time satellite data, and reinforcement learning to provide planetary
  intelligence for climate research, policy simulation, and sustainability analytics.
  The platform integrates data from World Bank, UNEP, NASA, and Copernicus Sentinel
  for 195 countries, featuring a 3D Digital Twin Earth, predictive climate modelling
  to 2100, and a multi-LLM AI assistant (Gaia) with Zero-PII architecture.
